        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:16px">Ready to Make Your Food Brand Irresistible?</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--stage-soft,#8e8e8e);margin-bottom:32px">Book a strategy call to review your current content, discuss what formats will work best for your product line, and build a UGC pipeline that keeps your ad account fed with fresh, high-performing creative every month. Whether you are launching a new flavor, scaling your DTC ads, or building content for a retail push, we will map out the creators, formats, and volume you need to hit your growth targets.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn dew" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a free strategy call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
